# Medic (friendly Army): a support trooper. The soldier's rounded helmet with a pale stripe and the steady blue lamp,
# a big pale med pack on the back with a blue plus (no red: Danger is for threats only), a hip satchel, a short
# carbine, the blue chest band (its light cue). Friendly shapes are rounded.
name medic
grid 5
size 16 14 36
slot body Olive
slot dark Ink
slot lamp AllyBlue
slot steel Steel
slot paper Snow
box 6 3 0 9 6 14 body
box 6 8 0 9 11 14 body
box 4 2 0 9 6 1 dark
box 4 8 0 9 12 1 dark
box 5 3 14 11 11 27 body
box 2 3 16 5 11 27 paper
paint box 2 6 18 3 8 26 lamp
paint box 2 4 21 3 10 23 lamp
box 7 11 12 11 13 17 paper
paint box 10 11 14 11 13 15 lamp
box 6 5 27 11 9 31 dark
ellipsoid 8 7 32 3.4 3 2.2 body
paint box 4 3 32 13 11 33 paper
box 11 4 30 13 10 32 lamp
# Cue band round the chest, readable from every side.
box 4 2 22 12 12 23 lamp
beam 8 2 24 13 4 25 0.9 steel
pivot 8 7 0
# R20 animation segments (Soldier gait roles): legs from the hip, the carbine (ArmR) from the grip, head at the neck.
part LegL 0 0 0 16 7 14 7.5 4.5 14
part LegR 0 7 0 16 11 14 7.5 9.5 14
part ArmR 11 0 22 16 7 27 11 3 24
part Head 0 0 27 16 14 36 8 7 27
